# The playground executes submitted Helix programs on a real binary, so it is OFF by
# default and a deployment must opt in deliberately. Local development is the one place
# that opt-in is unambiguous: it is your machine, your binary, your code.
#
# To enable it on a real deployment, set HELIX_PLAYGROUND=1 there — and read the guards
# in src/app/api/run/route.ts first (effect-based refusal, temp cwd, timeout, output cap).
HELIX_PLAYGROUND=1
